            "description_html": "<b>Fusion B-EL-C2, Stepped Scalloped Doorbell Buttons</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Navajo Stepped Scalloped Doorbell Buttons has a southwestern design esthetic. It comes packaged with the mounting screws necessary as well as with a lighted doorbell actuator. The rough texture of the rose grants this doorbell a weathered look.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Please Note</b> This is a replacement trim only. It comes packaged with lighted button, rosette, and installation screws. It DOES NOT include the chime.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Navajo Southwestern Doorbell Fusion C2:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 4-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Includes lighted button.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged as a kit with matching finish installation screws and a lighted button.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<b>** This item is Discontinued. See available <a href=\"/collections/door-bell-buttons\">Door Bells</a>.</b>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n</p>",
